1
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:17,900
The past isn't dead.

2
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:25,800
James. Fate draws us back together.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,400
Now your enemy is my enemy.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
-His name is Safin.
-And what does he want?

5
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,800
Revenge. Me.

6
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,100
When our secret finds its way out,

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
it'll be the death of you.

8
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,400
You can imagine why
I've come back to play.

9
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,000
There's a young lady in Santiago
I want you to meet.

10
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:55,000
-You're late.
-When you're ready.

11
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:00,300
Salute!

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,600
I met your new Double O.
She's a disarming young woman.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,500
I get why you shot him.

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,500
Yeah well, everyone tries at least once.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,600
James Bond.
